"Image 2, Grok Imagine Image 2, Imagen 4, Nano Banana, Nano Banana 2, Nano "
"Banana Pro, Qwen Image 2 Pro, Qwen Image Edit 2511, Seedream 5 Pro и Stable "
"Diffusion 3.5 Large Turbo."

